# modules/
#
# Each business module lives in its own subdirectory:
#
#   modules/
#   ├── auth/           Phase 1 — Authentication & Authorization
#   ├── customers/      Phase 2 — Customer Management
#   ├── designs/        Phase 3 — Design Management
#   ├── jobs/           Phase 4 — Job Management
#   ├── invoices/       Phase 5 — Invoice Management
#   └── payments/       Phase 6 — Payment Management
#
# Each module follows the vertical slice structure defined in 09_CODING_STANDARDS.md:
#
#   <module>/
#   ├── <module>.router.ts
#   ├── <module>.controller.ts
#   ├── <module>.service.ts
#   ├── <module>.repository.ts
#   ├── <module>.schema.ts       (Zod validation)
#   ├── <module>.types.ts
#   └── <module>.test.ts
